# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID. Get this from
# https://analytics.google.com/ → Admin → your property →
# Data streams → your web stream → "Measurement ID"
# (looks like G-XXXXXXXXXX).
#
# Vite only exposes env vars prefixed with `VITE_` to the
# client bundle. The ID is safe to commit in code; it's a
# public identifier (also known as the "G-ID" or "tag ID").
# The actual tracking-data API key is handled server-side
# by Google.
#
# In production (Vercel), set this as a project environment
# variable:
#   Vercel project → Settings → Environment Variables →
#   add VITE_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID = G-XXXXXXXXXX (Production)
#
# In development, leave this commented out and analytics
# will be a no-op (a console warning will fire if you load
# the production build without the ID set).
# VITE_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX


# --- Google Maps (the /map feature) -------------------------------------
#
# The map needs two values: an API key and a Map ID. When the visitor has
# not saved their own in the map's settings panel, the deployment falls back
# to these two.
#
# Vite bakes every `VITE_*` variable into the client bundle, so the key
# below ends up readable by anyone who opens the site. That is normal for a
# browser app - the key is protected by the restrictions you set on it in
# the Google Cloud Console (API restrictions + website/referrer
# restrictions), not by being secret. Set a billing alert on the Cloud
# project so a misuse of the key cannot run up a bill.
#
# A visitor's own key always wins: theirs is stored in their browser's
# local storage, and it overrides these values.
#
# In production (Vercel), set both as project environment variables
# (Production + Preview), then redeploy - the values are read at build
# time, so a change only reaches the site with the next build:
#   Vercel project -> Settings -> Environment Variables ->
#   VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY = AIza...
#   VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID  = <map id>
#
# In development, put them in a local `.env` file (git-ignored) to get the
# same behaviour as production.
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIza...
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID=5eebccd91c2197122cbd9062
